    "title": "This New Hampshire Hike Is Not For Anyone Scared Of Heights - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lila Merrick ,\n4 hours ago The trail is steep and exposed, and the drop-offs are sheer. This New Hampshire hike is not for anyone scared of heights. The route climbs up a rugged ravine, with sections that require scrambling over rocks and pulling yourself up by your hands. I stood at the base and looked up, feeling the weight of the challenge ahead. Read full article",
